  "description": "The Rizvum-pattern Swift Tank (UNSC Type classification: Type-48 Light Assault Gun Carriage, T-48 LAGC) is a fast Covenant fire-support vehicle whose medium plasma mortar fires quicker but lighter than the Wraith's. Its exposed crew of two rely on speed to strike and withdraw."
